  "offensiveAbilities": [
    {
      "name": "Furious Charge",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The megaloceros Strides twice and makes a hoof Strike after either Stride. If the Strike hits, the megaloceros deals an additional <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d4</span> bludgeoning damage.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>The megaloceros is similar in form to the elk, but far superior in size. The average male's antlers weigh nearly 100 pounds and can be wider than his body is long. Megaloceroses stand up to 9 feet tall, weigh 1,500 pounds, and grow antlers over 12 feet wide.</p>",
  "recallKnowledge": "Nature, DC: 21",
